    "text": "cbs2iowa.com\nwebsite\nCedar Falls\nCedar Falls home damaged by fire after tree falls on electrical line\nBy Iowa's News Now Staff,\n16 hours agoCEDAR FALLS, Iowa (Iowa's News Now) — An investigation is underway after a tree fell and caused a house to catch fire early Wednesday morning in Cedar Falls. Emergency crews responded to the 1000 block of Bluff Street around 2 a.m. after the Black Hawk County Dispatch Center received a report of a possible transformer fire.",
